<Positioned left="78" top="671"><Text fontSize="13" color="#8FA3C4" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">不是「下 60% 的时间」</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="32" top="696" width="356" height="46"><Container width="356" height="46" color="#16294B" borderRadius="10" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="706"><Text fontSize="17" color="#E2574C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">✗</Text></Positioned>
