<Positioned left="78" top="729"><Text fontSize="13" color="#8FA3C4" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">不是「全城 60% 地面」</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="32" top="754" width="356" height="46"><Container width="356" height="46" color="#16294B" borderRadius="10" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="764"><Text fontSize="17" color="#E2574C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">✗</Text></Positioned>
